    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d594">

                <pb facs="0825" n="723" sameAs="frus:frus1935v01/pg723"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">765.84/452: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Ethiopia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >George</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Addis Ababa</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1935-07-03T17:00:00+02:35">July 3, 1935—5
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received July 3—11:55 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>51. My telegram No. 50.<anchor n="33" xml:id="d594-f1"/> I have learned
                    confidentially Emperor will address a note to me tomorrow invoking Kellogg
                        Pact<anchor n="34" xml:id="d594-f2"/> and will release copies to other
                    Legations and press.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">George</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
